# LevelDB stores a pack as a mix of binary tables and small text files (CURRENT, MANIFEST-*).
# Git guesses the latter are text and rewrites their line endings on Windows checkouts, which
# corrupts the database. Built packs are the cg-misc-* directories; packs/_source holds the JSON
# they are built from and is deliberately outside this pattern, so the two never conflict.
packs/cg-misc-*/** binary
